~ main

if Global.talked_with_chicken == false:
	if true:
		Chicken: Cluck! Cluck! You're finally here!

		Player: What happened?

		Chicken: Your cow is missing!
		Chicken: She went into the jungle and never came back.

		Player: Why did she go into the jungle?

		- Did you see where she went?
			Chicken: Yes! I saw her walking toward the jungle.
			Chicken: She followed a strange glowing light.
			=> jungle_info

		- Is she still alive?
			Chicken: I don't know...
			Chicken: But I heard her mooing deep inside the jungle.
			Chicken: You have to find her!
			=> jungle_info

		- Was she alone?
			Chicken: Yes, but something was following her.
			Chicken: I saw strange monster footprints behind her.
			=> jungle_info


	~ jungle_info

	Player: What should I do?

	Chicken: You must enter the jungle and follow her trail.
	Chicken: But be careful!
	Chicken: The jungle is filled with monsters.

	Player: Monsters?

	Chicken: Yes!
	Chicken: They protect something called the Magical Stones.
	Chicken: You will need those stones to open the Red Gate.

	- I'll fight the monsters.
		Chicken: That's the spirit!
		Chicken: Defeat the monsters and collect every Magical Stone you find.
		=> adventure

	- Is there another way?
		Chicken: I'm afraid not.
		Chicken: The monsters won't let you pass peacefully.
		=> adventure

	- What happens if I don't collect them?
		Chicken: You won't be able to open the Red Gate.
		Chicken: And your cow is trapped somewhere beyond it.
		=> adventure


	~ adventure

	Chicken: Listen carefully before you leave.
	Chicken: Follow the path through the jungle.
	Chicken: Defeat the monsters blocking your way.
	Chicken: Collect the Magical Stones they guard.

	Player: And then?

	Chicken: When you have collected enough stones...
	Chicken: You will reach the Red Gate.

	Player: What is behind the Red Gate?

	Chicken: The monster boss lives there.
	Chicken: And I believe your cow is being held captive by it.

	Player: Then I'll defeat the boss and rescue her!

	Chicken: Exactly!
	Chicken: Don't give up, no matter how difficult the jungle becomes.

	Player: I'm ready.

	Chicken: Good luck, brave adventurer!
	Chicken: Bring our cow home! 
	Chicken: First of all bring me the magical orb. 
	Chicken: It is right beside the farm below.

	set Global.talked_with_chicken = true
	=> END


if Global.talked_with_chicken == true and GameController.total_coins != 1:
	Chicken: Where is the orb? Bring it if you want to go to the jungle. It is right beside the farm.
	=> END
 
if GameController.total_coins == 1:
	set Global.stone_recived_by_chicken = true
	Chicken: Thanks Now you can go to the forest!
	=> END
	
=> END
